Text/SMS Campaign Integration

The Text/SMS work combined both API integration and data engineering challenges. I worked with an external SMS Manager API, handled tokens that expired every 30 minutes, and built logic that could reliably create and subscribe phone numbers without failures.

I also built two Alteryx workflows:

The first loaded the incoming file into the SMS Opt-In Raw table.

The second was more complex — it moved data from Raw into the final SMS Opt-In table while validating and matching members against existing records.

Matching was particularly challenging because some phone numbers were formatted differently or member information didn’t align perfectly with what was already stored. I had to build logic to standardize values, identify mismatches, and ensure records were updated or inserted accurately without duplication.

